# 🍫 Chocolate Sales Data Analysis (Power BI Project)

## 📌 Project Overview
This project analyzes chocolate business sales data using Power BI to generate insights on sales performance, profit, shipments, and cost trends.

---

## 📊 Objectives
- Analyze total sales, profit, cost, and shipments
- Identify monthly trends and performance
- Compare KPIs using dynamic visuals
- Provide business insights for decision making

---

## 🛠 Tools Used
- Power BI
- Excel (Data Source)
- DAX (Data Analysis Expressions)

---

## 📁 Dataset
The dataset contains:
- Sales data
- Shipment details
- Cost and profit information
- Time-based data (Month, Year)

---

## 📈 Key Insights
- Identified top-performing months
- Compared Sales vs Profit trends
- Analyzed shipment distribution
- Highlighted cost variations

---

## 📊 Dashboard Features
- KPI Cards (Sales, Profit, Cost, Shipments)
- Trend Charts (Dynamic using Field Parameters)
- Month-over-Month comparison
- Interactive filtering

---

## 📂 Files Included
- `Chocolate_Sales_Data.xlsx` → Raw dataset
- `Chocolate_Dashboard.pbix` → Power BI report file

---

## 🚀 How to Use
1. Download the `.pbix` file
2. Open in Power BI Desktop
3. Explore dashboards and visuals

